change('bbe038','72236','The assessed operation is explaining bonding with an explicitly supplied overlap/occupancy model, not independently constructing valence configurations for arbitrary atoms/ions. Positive nuclei and negative electrons are the genuine existing atomic foundation.722 is not relabelled as an orbital model; orbital overlap, the provided opposite-spin pair and the attraction/repulsion explanation belong to bbe itself.','H2 supplies1s1 on both atoms, opposite-spin occupation and an energy-distance minimum; HCl supplies the singly occupied aligned Cl orbital and nonbonding pairs. Neither requires drawing F/F−/O/O2− valence boxes as an admission performance.','BY actualC9-NTG4 distinguishes simple valence configurations, overlap explanation and Lewis/mesomerie as separate competencies. Official whole page actually read; BB/BE common Bohr/Lewis does not automatically license orbital overlap.','Global requires correction does not adjudicate the already-existing bbe BB/BE target/source validity or make Pauli/Hund compulsory there. Preserve that explicit source/course HOLD for independent judgment.')
change('92c99','95dc','Keep the existing technical/symbolic-language prerequisite, including its own simple-formula foundation. Full independent molecular-ion resonance construction is not necessary for converting the supplied molecular representations. Do not require a separate whole235 nitrate/carbonate operation.','Both P cases fully supply connectivity: ethanol/ether givesC2H6O but different bonds and O lone pairs; ethene givesC=C and2C4H. Own operation teaches conversion and justified representation choice, including ambiguity.','BY/broad SekI representation operator and BB/BE SekI18/23/33 plus authoredE21 supply equations/representation changes/Lewis context. No new source-union approval follows.','No claim that reading a supplied simple Lewis sketch equals independent ionic resonance, Pauli/Hund or a whole235 mastery.')
change('67cd','92c99','Simple molecular representation literacy is the direct foundation for counting given bonding/lone electron domains. Orbital-overlap explanation and independent resonant-ion construction are distinct routines, not universal admission for these given-structure EPA cases.','H2O/CO2 input explicitly gives bonds and lone pairs; NH3/CH4 gives3+1 versus4+0 domains. Counts4/2 and4/4 determine bent/linear and pyramidal/tetrahedral without building a nitrate/carbonate ion or explaining orbital overlap.','ActualBW3.2.1.3(5) canonical source is a model-based spatial explanation; actualBB/BE authoredE19 and commonQ27 explicitly EPA and bonding repeat. New source mapping approval is not claimed.','EPA teaches its domain-to-shape reasoning itself. Exact angles or quantum orbital energies are not an extra prerequisite or new demand.')
change('8ceb','dd58 8d4','Hydrocarbon structure/class basics and chemical-versus-physical transformation are actual foundations. Reservoir geology, hydraulic stimulation, extraction methods and geopolitical import assessment are separate competencies and absent from both whole refinery cases.','All tower gradients/overlapping boiling ranges and oxygen-free cracking conditions are supplied. C12H26→C8H18+C4H8 andC6H14+C6H12; freshC10H22→C5H12+C5H10 all balanceC/H. Hydrocarbon classes/product interpretation and separation-versus-conversion matter; reservoir facts do not.','BB/BE authoredE23 explicitly diesel/cracking and SekI40 hydrocarbons; existingHE origin distinguishes refinery operations. The whole hydrocarbon foundation is used for meaningful class/formula interpretation and the no-unique-structure boundary.','No claim that all fractionation is a hands-on distillation performance or that atom balance fixes real product yields. Source/whole2be and its legitimate other-state duties remain untouched.')
change('64a5','431a','Use the existing coherent research/criteria/evidence-weighting argument foundation (which already requires5b1 source reading). Broad macro-/micronutrient classification, human-body nutrition and reflection on traditional nutrition choices are not universal admission for comparing protein products on declared function and evidence.','Both whole externally bound cases require actual own label/source research, all ecological/economic/ethical dimensions, counter-source/intent and a common protein/function basis. The7-point rubric remains1point for each independent criterion. No broad food-choice exercise is requested.','ActualBYC13GA4.11 explicitly requires this three-dimension protein-source research and critical-source operation. BB/BE methodological criteria/source standards and protein context are retained as actual separate components, not a new exact full mapping clearance.','Do not invent product data or researcher work. Protein content is used as a declared functional reference, not a claim of nutritional equivalence or medical advice. Newly required431a acquisition visibility must be measured honestly.')
change('a76a','799038 1dc15 a9c22','Use functional-group/structure reading and the existing amount-of-substance foundation; retain current orientation. The whole broad carbohydrate cluster would additionally require stereochemical/D-L/anomer/Haworth, di-/polysaccharide and detection routines not needed for either fully supplied glucose/process case.','Both completeDEEN materials explicitly supply D-glucose FischerOH positionsR-L-R-R, fiveOH, terminalCHO, ring/open-form boundary, molar masses, hydrolysis ratio and yields. They ask explaining structure and process, not independently deriving glucose stereochemistry or performing carbohydrate probes.','ActualBB/BE authoredE23 covers bioethanol/fermentation and glucose respiration comparison; source-specificHE topic history remains. Own a76 teaches its process/mass-yield/benefit-risk relation, with supplied structure card as actual material.','No statement that C6H12O6 alone identifiesglucose. No full876 mastery is implied by the given card; real laboratory execution remains separate from fictional process data. No new carb atom is invented.')
change('96fd','f0939 4928d','Retain the galvanic-cell foundation and use the existing heat/work/internal-energy/enthalpy distinction. Performing and interpreting an independent redox calorimetry experiment is not universal admission for simultaneous loadedU/I/t energy calculation.','All mechanism and measurement conditions are supplied. The tasks computeP,Q,W; time intervals and open-circuit variation; compare actual electrical work with given thermodynamic reference values. No calorimeter, temperature rise, heat capacity or measured reaction enthalpy is derived.','ActualBYC12GA8.2/EA8.2 separates cell context and work from voltage/current measurements.4928 provides thermodynamic boundary/quantity literacy; cc803 whole thermometry is preserved as separate legitimate common chemical-energy investigation.','The bounded−ΔG maximum relation is taught/applied within the retained work case under explicitT,p, not substituted by a claim that4928 teaches a full Gibbs derivation. Real measurements are not claimed from author numbers.')
change('311482','e9d34 197bc cf270 96d33','The actual broad SRS filter selects exactlyfiveGK/LK natural cards. Replace broad amino-acid chirality aggregate621 and combined ninhydrin+biuret execution5c8 by existing matching acquisition components: basic amino-acid/zwitterion e9d, peptide197 and specificallyBiuretcf270. Retain96d because card005 really distinguishes general reducing tests from glucose-specificGOD.','Card001/002 amino-acid/zwitterion,003peptide,004Biuret with≥2suitablepeptidebonds,005Fehling/Benedict/TollensversusGOD; the extra viscose card lacksGK/LK and is not selected. Historical origin tags, all front/back bodies and filters remain exact.','ActualBB/BE commonQ27/28 covers basic amino-acids/peptide/biuret; whole pH/Stokes/Fischer or ninhydrin are not silently equated with this card set. GOD/96d whole-source/acquisition remains an explicit separateHOLD if absent.','No M science vote, card edit, historical-origin rewrite or proof of actual lab execution. The real96d prerequisite is deliberately retained rather than removed for role closure.')
